:''Not to be confused with [[Ancient Egg: N110 (Rare Cat)|Farmboy Cat]].''
'''Farmer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]] and can be obtained by playing the   [[Summer Break Cats (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats]] Event Gacha.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 381
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Farmer Cat
|name2 = Harvest Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Harvest Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Farmer Cat can be used as a temporary replacement for [[Thief Cat (Rare Cat)|Thief Cat]] since she has better stats and is easier to upgrade to + levels, when comparing the first two forms of these Cats, but when you are in such a place with Farmer and Thief, you will probably be early in the game and unable to farm the + levels easily. You can safely forget about Farmer Cat once you unlock Thief Cat's [[True Form]], which gains Area Attack.

Other than that, use Farmer Cat similarly to Thief Cat, useful for getting extra money from peons, but nothing else.

